    {
      "text": "Agile ﬁxed-wing UAVs for urban swarm operations · 759",
      "bbox": [
        315.8710021972656,
        51.38132095336914,
        519.0736694335938,
        60.33945846557617
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "where nL and nD are the unit vectors in the lift and drag directions respectively. The lift and",
      "bbox": [
        88.68701171875,
        78.63479614257812,
        519.2576293945312,
        88.92676544189453
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "drag coeﬃcients CL and CD come from a linear and quadratic approximation of the lift and drag",
      "bbox": [
        88.68701934814453,
        90.54096984863281,
        519.1874389648438,
        100.88178253173828
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "coeﬃcients for a NACA 2412 airfoil. We also add a constraint on the angle-of-attack, α ≤αcrit,",
      "bbox": [
        88.68699645996094,
        101.9380874633789,
        519.0755615234375,
        112.25697326660156
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "where αcrit is the critical angle-of-attack.",
      "bbox": [
        88.68698120117188,
        114.45100402832031,
        268.71051025390625,
        124.79181671142578
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "For this simpliﬁed dynamics model, feasible trim conditions exist for a wide range of speed and",
      "bbox": [
        100.64297485351562,
        126.45584106445312,
        519.2813720703125,
        135.2528076171875
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "turning radius values. To reduce the set of possible solutions, we restrict ourselves to the set of",
      "bbox": [
        88.68697357177734,
        138.41085815429688,
        519.3104248046875,
        147.20782470703125
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "speeds and turning radii that minimize propulsive power.",
      "bbox": [
        88.68697357177734,
        150.36587524414062,
        338.70831298828125,
        159.162841796875
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
